 (9 different soundtracks) will relax and alert you when it's time to move!\n- Day, Night and Autumn worlds, for a grand total of 54 challenging levels (and more to come!): hours of challenging gameplay!\n- 2 Game modes : classic, challenge.\n- Challenge your friends with Achievements and Leaderboards!\n- Learn how to plumb and profit in real life!", "short_description": "Use your plumber powers to place pipes, join the vases and make the water flow!\nHelp little ducks to have fun surfing a water jet! You don't want to sadden a duck...\nBeware, make it in time, or the water will overflow..."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dreamteamgames.net/qtp/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Zgkaos", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://dreamteamgames.net/qtp/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8031955090180652"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65395359_1134747793794143_2250972718034778309_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hqsqArva-UgQ7kNvwHbdSgg&_nc_oc=Adk9pGN7mE_ULhnGHGd44SkexNNYx8cCOk96Uee-Tynmuzl6UlfTA6xZF69xdMV9SZI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfskEtiXpkkzqM_46XFhi62h1uo-8qI5ZK0IQAXUoxo8Hw&oe=69A05280"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false,